</style>
<h2>Asobi 0.2 (build 353)</h2>
<p><b>An honest connection chip on the web, and a copyable share identity in the app.</b></p>
<ul>
<li>The web page's follow control is now a four-state connection chip: <b>● LIVE</b> (riding the host), <b>FOLLOW</b> (click to latch back on), <b>WAITING</b> (connected, nobody else here yet), <b>OFFLINE</b> (no connection — comments still keep and deliver).</li>
<li>The Shared Review panel no longer shows an empty Passcode row for internet-hosted sessions — it shows what actually identifies the session: the passcode with a copy button when one exists, and the copyable web review link when hosting over the relay.</li>
<li>Fixed: a browser seat rejoining under the same name wasn't greeted by the host, so its page couldn't tell anyone was there. Hello replies are now rate-limited per name instead of once-ever.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
