<h2>Asobi 0.2 (build 347)</h2>
<p><b>The manual catches up, and the cheat sheet learns the new keys.</b></p>
<ul>
<li>The keyboard cheat sheet (H) now lists pointer selection: click to select a mark, drag to move it, Delete (⌫/⌦) to remove it, Esc to deselect.</li>
<li>The expert manual gains a full Web Review chapter — sharing, what guests can do, voice for the whole room, session-minute seats, originals policy, and notes that arrive while you're away — plus updated annotation and shortcut chapters.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
