<h2>Asobi 0.2 (build 341)</h2>
<p><b>Select a mark, restyle it — in the app, like the web.</b></p>
<ul>
<li>With a mark selected by the pointer, the palette's color swatches and stroke-width dots now restyle that mark instead of the brush — undoable, and every seat sees the change. With nothing selected they set the brush as before.</li>
<li>Guests can restyle their own marks; the host can restyle any.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
